.TH INPEDF 1 "November 2026" "inPeDF 0.2.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inpedf \- PDF reader for the GNOME desktop
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B inpedf
.RI [ FILE ... ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B inpedf
opens PDF documents using GTK 4, Libadwaita and Poppler.
It supports continuous and single-page views, text search and selection,
bookmarks, document outlines, thumbnails, printing and fullscreen presentations.
.PP
Files may be specified as paths or URIs.
When the application is already running, files are sent to the existing instance.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+O
Open a PDF document.
.TP
.B Ctrl+F
Search for text.
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Print the document.
.TP
.B F5
Start a presentation from the first page.
.TP
.B Shift+F5
Start a presentation from the current page.
.TP
.B Escape
Leave the presentation or clear the selection.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I $XDG_STATE_HOME/inpedf/documents.json
Reading positions and personal bookmarks.
The default state directory is ~/.local/state.
